Z||000051||Songman||07-21-2001||04:57 PM||||Good lord! Most of you people are so young! I think my Fieros are older than some of you! heheh<P>Still, it is nice to see some of the people that we spend so much time corresonding with. I know some of you better than I know some real people that are in my life everyday...<P>This is me and my hair is longer now too, Jeff! heheh<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.dalehouston.com/dale.jpg">  <P>Hey Lar! I love that 66! I want to get my 66 Star Chief Executive restored to that shape!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 07-21-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000052||Cheever2||07-21-2001||05:06 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/theylive(obey).jpg">  <HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Hmmm... what if that sign said "Do <B>Not</B> Obey"?  I mean, if you say "I will", then you didn't.  And if you say "Okay I won't", then you did.<P>Not enough sleep for the Cheevster.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 07-21-2001).]||||reg||1
